      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "There were no exclusions based on language or date of publication. We excluded studies exclusively on patients with substance use disorder or chronic pain, evaluating only opioids given during the ED stay, comparing different opioids head- to- head, not reporting pain intensities or pain relief (after contacting authors), or available only as abstracts.",
